hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1796","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apni do ungliyon se aisa farmatey huey dekha, darmiyaani aur angoothey se milne wali se: Main aur Qiyaamat in donon jaisey bheja gaya hun. (Bukhari: 4936)"
